insertBefore(newNode, referenceNode) — this inserts `li.nextElementSibling.nextSibling` before li, which is wrong; I want to move li after its next sibling. Correct: `ul.insertBefore(li.nextElementSibling, li)` — insert the next sibling before li, which effectively swaps them (moves li after next sibling). Let me fix that.

